Output src/generated/fix_typo_with_search.mp4
Require nvim

Hide
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 150ms
Type "nvim --clean src/generated/fix_typo_with_search.text"
Enter
Show

Type "/"
Type "b"
Type "l"
Type "u"
Enter
Type "c"
Type "w"
Type "b"
Type "l"
Type "u"
Type "e"
Escape

Escape

Hide
Type ":w!"
Enter
Show

Sleep 2s